- [ ] **Step 6: Write `src/location/locationStore.ts`**

A trivial singleton — no test needed (a two-function getter/setter with no branches). This replaces `TrackingToggle.tsx`'s current local `latestLocationRef`, so `CheckInOutScreen` (Task 4) can read the same latest GPS fix without either screen owning a second, redundant location watcher (there can only be one `BackgroundGeolocation` watcher active at a time).

```ts
// tablet/src/location/locationStore.ts
import type { GeoLocation } from './backgroundLocation'

let latest: GeoLocation | null = null

export function setLatestLocation(location: GeoLocation | null): void {
  latest = location
}

export function getLatestLocation(): GeoLocation | null {
  return latest
}
```

